</name><name><surname>Bhardwaj</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Faruquee</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Sabapathy</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Functional outcome of nerve transfer for restoration of shoulder and elbow function in upper brachial plexus injury</article-title><source>J Brachial Plex Peripher Nerve Inj</source><year>2008</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>15</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18505571</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1749-7221-3-15</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>